;s 5 grids came in under 90% of normal in September to October 40 times in 75 years since 1951, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle ran 156% of normal in April to May and 44% in October to November. So far in 2026 March to April came in at 40% of normal on the middle. Grids 21208, 21209 and 21210 had their driest year in 1965 at 68%.</p>"}
